27:["$","p","If another test is recommended, ask what question it is meant to answer and when it should be completed. If you are unsure whether a lab order is ready, established patients can ask through Healow before making a trip.",{"children":"If another test is recommended, ask what question it is meant to answer and when it should be completed. If you are unsure whether a lab order is ready, established patients can ask through Healow before making a trip."}]
28:["$","p","Do not assume that every symptom comes from the thyroid or that a reassuring number ends the discussion. Describe what is happening in ordinary language and allow the clinician to decide what else should be considered.",{"children":"Do not assume that every symptom comes from the thyroid or that a reassuring number ends the discussion. Describe what is happening in ordinary language and allow the clinician to decide what else should be considered."}]
29:["$","section","Make instructions easy to find later",{"id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Make instructions easy to find later"}],[["$","p","Before leaving, repeat back the next step in your own words: which test, what preparation, when and how the office will discuss it with you. Ask for clarification if instructions from different visits appear to conflict.",{"children":"Before leaving, repeat back the next step in your own words: which test, what preparation, when and how the office will discuss it with you. Ask for clarification if instructions from different visits appear to conflict."}],["$","p","Bring any specialist recommendations to your primary care appointment. If follow-up involves both offices, ask who should receive the results. Call for a time-sensitive concern rather than waiting for a portal response.",{"children":"Bring any specialist recommendations to your primary care appointment. If follow-up involves both offices, ask who should receive the results. Call for a time-sensitive concern rather than waiting for a portal response."}]],false]}]
